vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I0WnNU_Gm1UQ7kNvwEJN8aJ&_nc_oc=Adpvkuok__Lis1uUg-m0yn83qju1WJd2YoueOV-1IIlQNXpuNQIIU7GjAO1B6VwD9dQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyqWWvrbl-4QFJCPUo3IrhIfqpTg7eDseaBOMTNfWpOeg&oe=69C13A54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PEr9iiakNLAQ7kNvwGrYeGI&_nc_oc=AdqUFvke6FRMUxW6D09inxVfajYoZssJLFv1m4g5JlI8kldH5nJnWCsBZR-OKjx1pGU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyK2kdA8CzkQ8bISHEwjFqwAGSoyYLcob6t0yB5v6uNow&oe=69C13F32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UIiqcLPzsJAQ7kNvwFRptMc&_nc_oc=AdqFBCCFqHFMdYvZhbLrhSrWi5V7IZXxvevPEqZk43YN-DzR4_LYQU7fHzzp9i0Il4M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzaNzsKjBJzYFBEB-dZhmIShwfYC-vWU0W7J_xA4yl8GA&oe=69C14CD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "